    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2054170579465572597",
      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2054170579465572597",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2054170579465572597",
      "text": "Mga bagong pasilidad para sa lahat!\n\nPatuloy ang lokal na pamahalaan sa pagpapatayo ng mga imprastraktura upang matugunan ang pangangailangan ng bawat QCitizen.\n\nMakakaasa kayong prayoridad ng lokal na pamahalaan ang pagsulong ng ating lungsod kasabay ang pagpapaunlad ng ating komunidad.\n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng May 4, 2026. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n•  QMC Skatepark:\nhttps://t.co/3k2Nyl5Png\n\n• QMC Tennis Court:\nhttps://t.co/GhSj3PWhaM\n\n•  New Electric QCity Bus Units:\nhttps://t.co/gbuGxmVkPh\n\n•  Sagip Saka Day:\nhttps://t.co/OGvTQrDfXe\n\n• Rescue-buy - Vegetables from Atok Benguet:\nhttps://t.co/hOc7cmaSjL\n\nhttps://t.co/Xw0sqh7ivt\n\n• Rice Distribution:\nhttps://t.co/qvWzHgbXZ3\n\n• Fire assistance to the fire victims - Barangay Payatas:\nhttps://t.co/KaYDc5ScRu\n\n• Memorandum of Agreement Signing for No Juan Left Behind Food and Beverage training:\nhttps://t.co/O0Fw90CJit\n\n• MJB - Meeting with StITCH PH Project, Harvard Medical School, and Gilead Sciences:\nhttps://t.co/Mb1POl4hSd\n\n• \"Timeless: An Exhibit of Artworks\" Opening & Ribbon-cutting:\nhttps://t.co/caIhnJt48R\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
