      "id": "2054181963951747551",
      "url": "https://x.com/wpstransparency/status/2054181963951747551",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/wpstransparency/status/2054181963951747551",
      "text": "𝐏𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐄𝐑𝐒 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐖𝐒 𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝐓𝐎 𝐅𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐎 𝐅𝐈𝐒𝐇𝐄𝐑𝐌𝐄𝐍;𝐑𝐄𝐉𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐒 𝐂𝐇𝐈𝐍𝐀'𝐒 𝐂𝐎𝐄𝐑𝐂𝐈𝐕𝐄 𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐈𝐓𝐈𝐄𝐒 𝐈𝐍 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐖𝐄𝐒𝐓 𝐏𝐇𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐄 𝐒𝐄𝐀\n\nA wave of protesters gathered in front of the Chinese Embassy in Manila to express strong support for 𝐅𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐨 𝐟𝐢𝐬𝐡𝐞𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐧 and 𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐞 𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐥 operating in the 𝐖𝐞𝐬𝐭 𝐏𝐡𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐩𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐒𝐞𝐚. Carrying banners and placards, demonstrators called for protection of 𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐥𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐝𝐬, respect for  𝐏𝐡𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐩𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐬𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐧𝐭𝐲 and adherence to international maritime norms.\n\nOrganizers framed the rally as a peaceful appeal for maritime security and the safety of 𝐅𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐨 𝐟𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐰𝐬, urging 𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲 and 𝐚𝐜𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 in the region to prevent harassment and coercive activities at sea.\n\nSource: https://t.co/f0rARKyX0Z\n\n#WestPhilippineSea\n#WPSTransparencyInitiatives\n#PhSovereignty\n#VoiceForFisherfolks",
